{"id":"Prowl.Runtime.UI.UIInputField","name":"UIInputField","display":"UIInputField","kind":"class","assembly":"Prowl.Runtime","namespace":"Prowl.Runtime.UI","outer":null,"signature":"public class UIInputField : Selectable, IPointerDownHandler, IBeginDragHandler, IDragHandler, ISubmitHandler, ICancelHandler","bases":[{"name":"Selectable","id":"Prowl.Runtime.UI.Selectable"},{"name":"IPointerDownHandler","id":"Prowl.Runtime.UI.IPointerDownHandler"},{"name":"IBeginDragHandler","id":"Prowl.Runtime.UI.IBeginDragHandler"},{"name":"IDragHandler","id":"Prowl.Runtime.UI.IDragHandler"},{"name":"ISubmitHandler","id":"Prowl.Runtime.UI.ISubmitHandler"},{"name":"ICancelHandler","id":"Prowl.Runtime.UI.ICancelHandler"}],"docs":{"summary":"A single-line editable text field. Extends [`Selectable`](#api~Prowl.Runtime.UI.Selectable) so it gets the hover/focus tint, and drives a child [`TextComponent`](#api~Prowl.Runtime.TextComponent) for the visible text plus optional caret and selection images that it positions each frame using [`MeasureWidth`](#api~Prowl.Runtime.TextComponent~MeasureWidth). Supports caret movement (arrows, Home/End), Backspace/Delete, drag- and shift-selection, select-all, and clipboard cut/copy/paste. The text scrolls horizontally within the field so the caret stays visible; pair the field with a [`RectMask`](#api~Prowl.Runtime.UI.RectMask) to clip the overflow."},"attributes":["AddComponentMenu","ComponentIcon"],"members":[{"kind":"property","name":"TextComponent","signature":"public TextComponent? TextComponent { get; set; }","docs":{"summary":"The label that shows the current text. Required for the field to render anything."},"static":false,"obsolete":false,"line":34,"path":"Prowl.Runtime/Components/UI/Input/UIInputField.cs","anchor":"TextComponent"},{"kind":"property","name":"Placeholder","signature":"public TextComponent? Placeholder { get; set; }","docs":{"summary":"Optional label shown only while the field is empty."},"static":false,"obsolete":false,"line":3